Dorcan is one of the three founders of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] and is a god. He began as a mortal and rose to godhood. When the Pale consumed the old landmasses of [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]], he remade new landmasses out of it, and the people of Ushas live on that new ground.
